Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.62,0:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Triangle Heart 3: Lyrical Toy Box.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.93,0:00:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems we'll appear in this one!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.13,0:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our first time doing this, huh? \NKinda makes me nervous.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.20,0:00:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just do our best like we always do.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.04,0:00:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,First up, we've got...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.56,0:00:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uminari Hyper Quiz-a-Palooza!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of title is that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole city of Uminari becomes a quiz stage!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.09,0:00:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Broadcast live on TV, you'll face off in quiz battles against us,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.96,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and all sorts of familiar faces!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.16,0:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can choose your character from the Triangle Heart 3 cast.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.80,0:01:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you play as and who you meet changes the story.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.20,0:01:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The questions are all general knowledge,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.34,0:01:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so even if you haven't played much of the series, you'll still have a great time.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.41,0:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hear the host of the show is... that person.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.24,0:01:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uminari Hyper Quiz-a-Palooza!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.25,0:01:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming soon, so be sure to check it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.58,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.58,0:01:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira's Dynamite Hammer!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wield your keyboard like a pair of iron fists,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.57,0:01:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and smack Ren whenever \Nshe pops her head out of a hole!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.94,0:01:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be tossing out items to help you, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.58,0:01:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho! I'm not gonna go down that easily!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.68,0:01:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch out for Ren's counterattacks!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.68,0:01:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're in trouble, unleash your special move like this!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.10,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for killing a little time, or blowing off some steam with a quick and easy game.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.69,0:02:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.30,0:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovey-Dovey Partner.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.52,0:02:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...That's kind of an embarrassing title...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.58,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's basically just a desktop clock.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.92,0:02:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It announces the time and has a simple timer function,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.74,0:02:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you click on us, we'll even talk back.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.56,0:02:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also a voice collection that was so popular last time,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.93,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,plus wallpapers and screen savers by our guest artists.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.88,0:02:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made sure to include all the essentials.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.94,0:02:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for this collection's main attraction...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.50,0:02:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A treasure box wouldn't be complete without this!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.31,0:03:01.71,Narrator,,0,0,0,,An ordinary girl living an ordinary life, \Ndespite growing up in a rather unusual family.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.71,0:03:06.65,Narrator,,0,0,0,,One mysterious incident changes Takamachi Nanoha's life forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.65,0:03:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... let my voice reach you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.26,0:03:16.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A mysterious woman who came from a distant land...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.06,0:03:17.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Lindy-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.50,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Raging Heart?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.17,0:03:26.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Guided by Lindy-san, \Nshe encounters the power of magic.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.17,0:03:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanoha...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.41,0:03:33.15,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And a new friendship with Kuu-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.78,0:03:38.92,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Spring arrives, half a year after that heartbreaking farewell.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.92,0:03:42.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,We met someone truly precious,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.39,0:03:46.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and learned so very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:54.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A story woven by a young girl, connecting the past, the present, and the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.04,0:03:58.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,She has to find happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.54,0:04:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we get to have a little story of our own in this one, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.83,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure seems that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.10,0:04:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's Triangle Heart 3: Lyrical Toy Box!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.39,0:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Compatible with Windows 95, 98, 2000, and ME.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Suggested retail price: 6,800 yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.58,0:04:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now on sale at computer stores nationwide!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.23,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope to see you again in the new spring!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.19,0:04:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please support us!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.01,0:04:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.10,0:04:53.56,Song,,0,0,0,,Take my hand and dance a few steps, and before you know it, you'll be smiling.
Comment: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.56,Song,,0,0,0,,
